    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "A “musical ritual” for four voices (Op. 42, 1973–83), to lyrics by Agathi Dimitrouka, Aris Davarakis and the composer. Sixteen ballads of a nocturnal Athens: “Treis dolofonoi”, “Nychterina agalmata”, “Dyo paidia mes sti vrochi”, “O politis idanikon stigmon”. Cover painting by Yannis Moralis."
